<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Aug/s.a trade figures delayed until Jan 15.</title>
<headline>Irish Aug/s.a trade figures delayed until Jan 15.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish trade figures for August which were due for release on Thursday have been delayed and will be announced on Wednesday January 15, the Central Statistics Office (CSO) said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom 353-1-6603377</p>
</text>
